.nh
.TH "PB-POLICY-VERSIONS" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-policy-versions - List saved policy versions


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb policy versions [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List every saved version of the workspace policy, newest first, with who
saved it, when, how (saved, restored, rewritten or migrated), how many access
grants it added and removed, and its message. Print one with pb policy get
--version N and go back to one with pb policy restore N.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for versions

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb policy versions
  pb policy versions --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-policy(1)\fP
